    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Upcoming Open Viewing:\r\n8 Oct, 17:30 - 17:45\r\n\r\nArtis is delighted to present this wonderfully spacious second-floor two-bedroom apartment with its own allocated surface car parking space. This modern apartment is notably bright and spacious throughout and benefits from a spacious balcony. Its proximity to the local Centra store, the hairdressers and Early Learning Crèche makes for a very convenient choice. There are two on-site gyms where owners can benefit from complimentary membership and the proximity of the canal allows for leisurely walks. Throughout the proportions are generous and a wonderful quality of natural light abounds.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property one is welcomed by a spacious hall leading to all the principle rooms, the large south facing open plan Kitchen/living area lies to the front of the property and opens to a spacious balcony. There is a well equipped kitchen with ample built in units. To the rear there are two spacious double bedrooms with the main bedroom benefiting from a well equipped ensuite. A large well equipped bathroom, utility cupboard and useful storage room complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThere is an abundance of local amenities nearby at Rathbourne including Aldi (5-mins walk), Supervalu, a Coffee Shop, Asian/Thai Restaurant & Bar, Hairdressers & chemist shop, all adjacent to Ashtown Train Station which is a mere 10-minute stroll. The train offers easy access to the city centre with Pelletstown the nearest station only a 4-minute walk away. The development is also serviced by Dublin Bus with numerous bus services operating nearby on the Navan Road.\r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT COMPANY:\r\nKingfisher Management Company\r\n\r\nSERVICE CHARGE:\r\nApprox. €2,477.47\r\n\r\nBER DETAILS:\r\nBER Rating: C1\r\nBER Number: 102474517\r\nEnergy Performance: 157.98 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nHallway 1.31 x 5.44\r\nLaminate floor, storage heater, ceiling mounted spotlights, storage press\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.96 x 2.22\r\nTiled floors, dimplex towel rail, bath tub with shower, WC & hand basin\r\n\r\nOpen plan living/dining and kitchen area\r\n4.73 × 6.23\r\nLaminate floors with tile to kitchen area, storage heating, access to balcony\r\nStylish built in wall and floor units, electric hob and oven, built in fridge/freezer & storage\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.74 x 4.55\r\nCarpet, inbuilt wardrobes, storage heater\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.52 x 2.33\r\nTiled floors, shower, basin & WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.68 x 2.91\r\nCarpet floors, storage heater, in built wardrobe"
      },
